  message: "Fixed in PR #1258 (9fe0315c85). Prelude.readIO removed from the fs_read row (readFile stays; readLn stays ipc_recv because its getLine half reads stdin). Behavioural evidence on merged dev: parseIt s = readIO s produces no chain (was fs_read Prelude.readIO); readFile control still fs_read; verify-claims {boundary: fs_read, must_not_exist: true} over a program whose only 'read' is readIO no longer returns violated (production-path test test_haskell_rows_that_cross_nothing.py). NOT asserted: the family peers named in the description (python ast.literal_eval / json.loads, go fmt.Sscan*) were not adjudicated here."  # 1d01
